 e did not enlist himself\, he witnessed key events of the war for independ
 ence while with Col. Ledyard. The presentation is based on extensive resea
 rch in the collections of the Connecticut State Library and the Museum of 
 Connecticut History.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/portrayal-jorda
 n-freeman-fight-set-people-free
