DESCRIPTION:Eddie Jaku\, a German-Jewish survivor of Auschwitz concentrati
 on camp\, considers himself “The Happiest Man on Earth”\, despite losi
 ng his family\, friends\, and country to the Holocaust. In this one-man sh
 ow\, Jaku takes us through the day he was taken by the Nazis and his seven
  years of imprisonment\, up to today\, where he is dedicated to sharing th
 e stories of those lost and teaching others how to find the light in the d
 arkness.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/happiest-man-earth
LOCATION:Playhouse on Park\, 244 Park Road\, West Hartford CT\, 06119
